<h1 class="page-title">ManualRetryPlugin</h1>
<p class="page-lead">Stores terminal failures in <code>MANUAL</code> mode and lets you replay them on demand — on reconnect, after user action, or on app resume. Built-in idempotency safeguards and age limits prevent unsafe replay.</p>

